cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use furst-optics in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: furst-optics
abstract: >-
  furst-optics is a Python library which models the optical system of the
  Full-sun Ultraviolet Rocket Spectrometer (FURST), a NASA sounding rocket
  mission which measures the spectrum of the whole Sun in the far ultraviolet
  at high spectral resolution. Built on optika, it includes both the optical
  design and the instrument as it was built and flown, for use by the FURST
  data reduction pipeline.
authors:
